{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52717","headline":"还丹口诀 · 白履忠","name":"还丹口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水中铅，火里铅，水火二铅同一原，不知咫尺是神仙。\n敬将朱砂酒醋煎，千千万万化爲烟。\n假如伏火只成顽，欲得人间作地仙。\n炼取五行四象全，阴功济世真上天。\n（後蜀无名氏《大还丹照监》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白履忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}